WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.536
Post a photo is first on Quick update.

2
00:00:02.536 --> 00:00:04.933
It opens one step at a time.

3
00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:07.663
Take a photo with your camera.

4
00:00:07.663 --> 00:00:10.391
Or pick one you already have.

5
00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:11.000
Then describe it, choose
where it goes, and save.

6
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.310
It is a draft until you press Publish.
